  "summary": {
    "text": "GPT-2 is a transformer language model from OpenAI with up to 1.5 billion parameters, trained on about 40GB of internet text and described by OpenAI as a direct scale-up of GPT. Citing concerns about malicious use, OpenAI released its weights in stages during 2019, from a 124M model in February to the 1.5B model in November.",
